  "question": "What\u2019s the nearest museum you\u2019d reach going toward Chicago-Kent College of Law, Chicago, IL from Hickory Grove Riverfront, Cary, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.207814 42.234515)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.642099 41.878862)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'museum'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.207814 42.234515)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.207814 42.234515)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
